# Workspace-root .gitignore: everything is ignored EXCEPT the code and docs.
# The nested kaitan_app/.gitignore still governs the Flutter project's own
# per-file ignores; this file only controls what is visible at the root.

# Ignore everything at the root by default
/*

# Then re-include the things we DO want tracked
!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/kaitan_app/
!/docs/
# Shopify unlock-code delivery (Google Apps Script). Holds no codes, tokens or
# secrets: those live only in the client's Google account.
!/shopify_code_delivery/
